      },
      {
        "text": "A major obstacle to effective efforts in rural areas is the lack of access to credit.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Rural areas typically lack large financial institutions like JPMorgan Chase.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a need to redirect resources directly to underserved rural areas.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Expanding access to both credit and alternative transportation improves individual choice and well-being.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Small community banks in rural areas are deteriorating due to insufficient support.",
        "confidence": 0.88
