    "turn_idx": 176,
    "turn_text": "Thank you, Clint, for being here. I look forward to doing what we can to make sure that we work on the things that the tech industry needs because I think that Utah is such a great example in this area. I know that you guys are focused on education and diversity, recruiting and making sure you have that workforce. I want to do everything I can to help because I know that I have children in the STEM",
